WEBVTT

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:39.940
Wow! Here comes a big twist in the midst of the Justice 5!

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:45.650
The G-Revolutions have made
an incredible counterattack!

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:54.890
With Kai Hiwatari and Takao Kinomiya's wins, each team is at a completely even score!

00:01:54.890 --> 00:02:00.760
How will the winner
be decided now?!

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.700
Extra! Extra!

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:14.000
This is Beyblade News.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.560
After the Justice 5
ended in a draw,

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:23.340
BEGA Chairman Volkov has announced
that a sixth match will take place

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:26.500
with each team choosing one
player to represent them.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.650
The Justice 5's sixth match!

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:34.100
This is going to be
the real final battle!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.420
Oh my goodness...

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.170
This has become
quite the predicament!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:49.020
After that deathmatch
just ended, too...!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.010
I pray they are alright...

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.000
Children!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.300
Hey there, old man.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.840
Sorry for making
you worry, Yuriy.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.300
But we've come
all this way!

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.660
I'm not a doctor, but Yuriy's face
looks like it regained color.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:37.450
One last battle.
Let's do our best. For Yuriy.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.780
Yeah. Of course!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:44.300
Yuriy, by the time
you wake up...

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:50.580
We're gonna get Beyblading back to the good old days! The kind we fought in!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.930
I promise!
We're going to win.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.400
We will.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.000
Takao.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:01.620
We don't have anything
left to say at this point.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:05.040
Do your best in the
final battle, Takao!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.660
Guys...

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:13.380
Guess I can't say no.
I'll leave the final battle to you!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:16.840
But you better not lose!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.480
Yeah!

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.170
Why...

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.040
I don't understand...

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.040
--I can't see anything...

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.490
I realize this is sudden, but I'm a little disappointed in you, Coach Kinomiya.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:49.960
And while I'd like to consider
it a way to excite the crowd...

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.520
This time, it's serious.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:05:00.880
Despite ending in a draw, the fact that
we lost our advantage looks bad on us.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.490
As such, we must
win this next match.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.610
We must dominate.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:12.820
And crush those BBA pests!

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:17.720
We must show the
masses the power of BEGA!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:18.900
Yes, sir.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.220
But Chairman Volkov...

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.660
Is a show of force
truly a Beybattle?

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.820
What?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.250
The audience wants a duel
of passionate Beyspirits.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:35.250
To see Bladers compete
with all they've got.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:39.650
That's why Beyblading is
intense, full of passion, and fun!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.040
Get to the point.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:45.410
Yes... We must first
acknowledge our rivals.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:48.620
Acknowledge? Fun?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.950
Losing to Kinomiya
has made you soft.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:59.530
Wake up and face
reality, you goddamn loser!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:13.600
Niceties won't work this
late in the game, Garland!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.140
We will do whatever
it takes to win.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.720
You know what to do,
Coach Kinomiya.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:23.000
Yes. Brooklyn, you mean.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.060
But Brooklyn is...

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.380
Leave it to him.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.760
In the meantime, I will figure out
a plan to ensure our victory.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.860
No... Coach Kinomiya!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.810
Moses is back, yes?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.600
Call Ming-Ming!
And Mystel, too!

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.490
Coach! Wait!

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.600
Are you serious?

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:53.960
I don't think Brooklyn has it
in him to fight right now!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:58.200
Allow me to risk my
Blader pride once more!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.370
Blader pride...

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.250
I can't use you.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.740
Your strength is your ability to practice and
study more than any normal person could.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:16.980
But the battle is soon. Can you improve to the point of surpassing Takao Kinomiya?

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:19.640
I...

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:26.130
Brooklyn with his natural talent is
the only one who can pull that off.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.600
Have faith
in your teammate.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.490
Teammate...

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.050
How?
I don't understand.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:38.170
I can't see anything...

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:42.370
Well? Still not
convinced you lost?

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.120
I lost...?

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.700
I don't blame you. You made it
this far with your natural talent.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:02.860
Victory or defeat was never a concern. As long as you played, your victory was guaranteed.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.080
And yet, you lost.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.930
You can't grow if you
don't accept that as reality.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.280
Listen to me. You lost.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.730
I lost...?

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.240
Coach Kinomiya.
Could it be that...

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:24.230
You knew this
would happen?

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.690
You're lying! I didn't lose!
That's impossible!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.090
Take this, Brooklyn.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.450
No!!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.200
I don't know
what that is!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.890
I don't understand them!

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:45.320
On your feet. I thought I showed you a world outside your head.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:52.140
You won't be able to reach their world unless
you overcome your humiliating defeat!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.880
Their world?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.980
That's right.
Ask your Bey!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:02.160
By fighting together, Bladers can
learn the true joy of Beyblading!

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:05.310
True... Joy...

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:13.330
A Beyblade's voice?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.360
What nonsense!

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.600
Those people...

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:26.120
You can't grow if you
don't accept that as reality.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.380
Ask your Bey!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.980
Brooklyn!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.850
Those people...!!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.340
I hate them!!

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.700
What is this?

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.960
You're sending us
to Kinomiya's house?

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.960
That is correct.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.380
Consider it a "warm up"
for the next battle.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.010
I'm sure you understand
what I'm referring to.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.360
You must mean...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.140
A sneak attack?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.450
But I have my
pride as a Blader...

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.240
Pride?

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:28.180
Moses. I hear your sister's
operation succeeded without a hitch.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.320
Yes.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:32.130
Who paid for those?

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:36.810
Perhaps there will be more fees to pay before she leaves the hospital.

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:39.610
But those
are two different...

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:42.800
They are one and the same!
Think about it!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.810
Why do you think I've
invested so much into you?

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:52.000
It's all in exchange for the successful establishment of my pro league!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:57.700
If we lose the next battle,
then everything is null and void!

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.930
But sir...

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:04.820
You have a duty to
follow my orders.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:09.300
Um, well, I'm a
pop singer, so...

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.560
If I get caught getting my hands
dirty, it'll affect my image!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:17.100
Your pop career only exists
because of BEGA's support!

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:20.920
Who cares about pride?!
Or pop idols?!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.130
You don't get to refuse me!

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:28.340
Get out and tear Takao
Kinomiya's Dragoon into scrap!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.520
Where the hell is Mystel?!
You worthless pieces of--

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.330
How rude of him!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.880
What should we do?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:48.350
I don't know...

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.140
We have to go!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.460
Hey, wait!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:27.930
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.810
Those people...!!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.650
I hate them!!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.740
Is that Brooklyn's true power?

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.920
I had no idea he
was this powerful...

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:25.360
It's the final battle...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:32.360
If I lose, Beyblading will be in
the palm of Volkov's hands!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:35.220
I won't let that happen!

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:39.170
For the friends who
trust in me! For Yuriy!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.700
And for Kai...

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:43.510
Just one more match!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:46.220
I'm counting on you, Dragoon!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.200
Time for bed!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.900
--Go, Shoot!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:02.760
A Bey?!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.080
What in the world?!

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.800
What is...

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.480
It's you!

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.930
We challenge you, Kinomiya!
Get your Beyblade!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.370
What?!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.360
How could this happen?!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.820
Moses! Ming-Ming!

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.540
What the heck are you
guys trying to pull?!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:55.200
It's obvious. They're trying to disqualify us from the match.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:58.250
Your true colors
have come out!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.970
No! They're BEGA members, but...

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.540
They wouldn't go this low!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.660
But it's clear they're here
to attack Kinomiya!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.200
I won't let you get away with
coming to screw with us.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.220
Say what you want!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.900
We can't leave
empty handed!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.770
Prepare yourself, Kinomiya!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.600
Go, Gigars!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:25.420
Venus!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.560
No choice!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.870
What?!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.220
Not one more step.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.050
Not until you beat us!

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:47.960
Bastards!

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:53.490
Blast!
Out of our way!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.420
Make way, boys!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:09.890
Battling one-on-one's
getting us nowhere!

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:14.740
Ming-Ming! Let's ram straight
through their defense!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.040
Right!

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.520
They're trying to
break past us!

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.460
Yeah, I'll take 'em on!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.090
Move!!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.690
You aren't
getting to Kinomiya!

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:41.160
The future of
Beyblade depends on it!

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.720
Rick... Rai...

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:46.860
Stop, Rick!
This battle is pointless!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.290
You too, Moses! This isn't what
your Beyblade fights for!

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.080
Would your sister be
happy to see you do this?!

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:09.560
Rei...!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:14.320
Volkov saved Monica!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.040
I owe him!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.820
Yeah! What would I
do without BEGA?!

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:28.050
No! Even without BEGA, your career as a pop idol is unstoppable!

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:32.280
I accept that you're
a top-class Blader...

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.360
Fair and square...

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:38.050
Don't let me down!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.760
Mr. Monkey boy...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:51.050
It's too late for me
to back down now!!

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.470
Takao!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.540
--Takao!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.410
Moses! That's enough!

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.960
This can't keep up...

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.770
But...

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.290
I can't do it!!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.480
I can't...

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:40.580
I just can't do it. Winning like this doesn't make me happy.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:44.090
This isn't a real battle!

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.500
Moses...

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.920
Way to freak out a guy...

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.210
I'm glad you're okay!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.840
I believed.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:58.110
You were right. They wouldn't do something this low on purpose.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.700
We fought them, so we
know that the best, right?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.770
Takao!

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:05.020
Yes, you're right!

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.650
That's it!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.010
Well done, Takao.

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:12.080
It's Volkov's fault
for forcing them!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.200
That's why I'm going
to defeat BEGA!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:21.170
So I can fight Bladers like
you on equal terms!

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:22.720
Kinomiya...

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.700
I'm so sorry, Kinomiya...

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.890
We're done here.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:31.020
But what about Mr. Volkov?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:36.330
This is the choice we made.
Return with pride.

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.840
You mustn't run
from your problems.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.320
Garland...

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.500
I'm sorry for all
the fuss, Kinomiya.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.520
I'm looking forward
to your battle.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:57.000
But be careful.
It won't be easy!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.260
What's that mean?

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:03.140
This genius is motivated
enough to take up Beyblade.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.900
Brooklyn did?!

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:08.960
Brooklyn has gotten serious,
despite his typical loathing of Beyblade.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.210
For the first time, he's approaching
this match on his own will.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:14.940
I'm sure you know
what this means.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.450
Someone Kai sacrificed
everything to beat.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:21.610
Kai had to push
himself so hard to win...

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:24.560
Is he more
powerful than before?!

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:28.450
And then there's
Hitoshi Kinomiya.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:31.010
I imagine that this
is all his doing.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:35.690
If you're not ready for it, you might be the next to be sent to hell!

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.220
I will win.
I am a god.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.420
No one can touch me.

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:52.050
Irony is cruel, Takao.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:55.780
You made it this far because
of Kai Hiwatari's victory.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:21:01.720
But that victory gave birth
to your ultimate rival.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.620
Will your love for Beyblade
win the final match?

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:27.920
Or will this genius
squash that love?

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.820
I challenge you, Takao!

00:22:56.060 --> 00:22:58.610
Howl, Seiryu!
Fire up, Dragoon!

00:22:58.610 --> 00:23:02.610
A Bey's cry is my heart!
A fiery clash is my soul!

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:05.330
Let me show you, Brooklyn!

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:07.000
The joy of Beyblade!

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.860
How great it is to
fight your best!

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.020
A real heartfelt battle!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:14.080
Do it, Kinomiya!
Show me what you've got!

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:18.480
--Three! Two! One! Go, Shoot!

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.050
Take this!
This is our awesome Beyspirit!
